Package: tp-link-onu-monitor
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Developer <dev@example.com>
Depends: python3, python3-requests, python3-rsa, python3-paho-mqtt, python3-influxdb-client, python3-flask, adduser, sudo
Description: TP-Link XZ000-G7 GPON ONU Monitor
 A daemon that scrapes optical stats from the TP-Link ONU and publishes them to MQTT and InfluxDB.
 Includes a Web GUI on port 8991 (HTTP Basic auth) for configuration from another device on the LAN.
